@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, mssql
+    :tickets: 1187
+
+    Properly escape constraint name on SQL Server when dropping
+    a column while specifying ``mssql_drop_default=True`` or
+    ``mssql_drop_check=True`` or ``mssql_drop_foreign_key=True``.
+
